:: Widgets MP NPC Vesper [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpInitNpcVesper">>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, axis: 0, axisLabel: "契约", manifests: 0, shipTier: 0, voyageLane: "none", deepStage: 0, clausePages: 0, nextStepDay: 0, setback: 0, rep: 50, weekKey: -1, upkeepWeek: -1, relDay: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.axis is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper.axisLabel>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axisLabel to "契约">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.manifests is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.manifests to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.shipTier is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.shipTier to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.vesper.voyageLane>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.voyageLane to "none">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.deepStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.deepStage to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.clausePages is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.clausePages to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.nextStepDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.nextStepDay to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.setback is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.setback to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.weekKey is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.weekKey to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.upkeepWeek is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.upkeepWeek to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.vesper.relDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.relDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpInitNpcSera">>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25, fatherLog: 0, rep: 50, questStage: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.cadence is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to 25>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.axis is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to 25>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.fatherLog is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.fatherLog to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.sera.questStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.questStage to 0>><</if>>
<<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts is undefined ? 3 : $mpClockParts)>>
<<set _seraWeekNow to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
<<if $mpSeraWeekId isnot _seraWeekNow>><<set $mpSeraWeekId to _seraWeekNow>><<set $mpSeraW1 to 0>><<set $mpSeraW2 to 0>><<set $mpSeraW3 to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$mpVesperEnded and $mpWorldVesperEnding>><<set $mpVesperEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpWorldVesperEnding is "freeport">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_npc.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -25>><</if>><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
咸湿海雾漫过旧港三号栈桥尽头的木结构船屋窗棂，昏黄风灯在潮声里轻轻晃动，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>就着风灯读过水尺，长桌上摊着契约轴 <<print _npc.axis>>、暗港舱单 <<print _npc.manifests>> 份、座船 <<print _npc.shipTier>> 阶与旧航附页 <<print _npc.clausePages>> 页。<<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.vesper>>船钟下压着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.vesper>>」。<<else>>暗流拍打着木桩。<</if>><<if $mpWorldVesperEnding is "freeport">>自由航线挂牌后，每周要交一笔三号栈桥泊位费。<<elseif $mpWorldVesperEnding is "shadowfleet">>转入暗影船队后，白昼灯船线停航，舱单进项少了一截。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[调度夜航委托 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[查看座船改造台 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Subsys]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<link [[查看船屋封航木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpVesperEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldVesperEnding is "shadowfleet">><<link [[重温暗影船队终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重温自由航线终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[去他现在所在 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP NPC Vesper Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
三号栈桥的平底艇还拴在铁环上。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>合上黄铜水尺，说末班沉船的旧档只在白昼八点至十八点退潮窗才敢下仓核对，且每查一步都要隔天等海关巡艇换防。<<if (_npc.clausePages or 0) lt 6 and (_npc.deepStage or 0) lt 5>>手头的旧航附页眼下只攒了 <<print (_npc.clausePages or 0)>> 页，还得靠每周夜航结算一页页补齐。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明天再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
船屋窗户拉上了遮光黑布，栈桥入口横着「封航整备」的铁链。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>隔着木门低声嘱咐：上次查探失手惊动了港务稽查艇，不仅赔上了一份舱单与码头声望，这两天三号栈桥都有暗哨盯梢，过两天再来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Tier Action [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
船屋壁挂的风灯随着海风微晃，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把盛着热朗姆茶的搪瓷杯推过桌面。当前契约刻度停在 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if _npc.axis gte 60 and (_npc.love or 0) gte 20>>底舱暗格与应急快艇的钥匙已经交由你随意取用，他的副舵位永远为你空着<<elseif _npc.axis gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>他出航前会把真实的回港潮位与暗号交底给你<<else>>他仍按港口的规矩与你一事一议，但算账从不亏待你<</if>>。
栈桥下的暗流轻轻拍打着木桩，风灯在潮湿的舱板上映出一圈暖黄。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[饮热茶核潮信 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpVesperTierTea>><<set $daily.mpVesperTierTea to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深谈沉船湾往事 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<if _npc.axis gte 15 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 5>><<if !$daily.mpVesperTierDeep>><<set $daily.mpVesperTierDeep to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 6)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[陪他给缆绳打热蜡 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Loop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_vesper isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_vesper to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper to "none">><</if>>
潮汐图上排着三枚压线铜坠，当前暗港舱单存有 <<print _npc.manifests>> 份，雾潮水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>说一个夜潮窗口只够跑一条航线：要么贴着近岸暗礁快进快出，要么趁浓雾横穿外海灰雾航道；本轮潮窗<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "reef">>已走近岸暗礁，外海灰雾道已退潮封航<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "fog">>已入灰雾航道，近岸礁口已被暗流封死<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship">>已划艇去接堤外灯船，近岸与外海两线都随退潮封航<<else>>选定一条便会关掉另一条<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[驶向近岸暗礁 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Reef]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<mpveilicon>><<link [[横穿外海灰雾道 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Fog]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "none" and !$daily.mpVesperThird>><<mplampicon>><<link [[划艇去堤外接灯船 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper to "lightship">><<set $daily.mpVesperThird to 1>><<set _npc.voyageLane to "lightship">><</link>><<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship" and !$daily.mpLoopSettleVesper>><<link [[回堤外灯船结算单 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><<else>><<link [[灯船航线今日已封 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Loop Reef [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "fog" or $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship">>
近岸暗礁的水位已经退到底，黑色的礁石像锯齿一样露在水面上。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>收起撑篙说，因为今晚先跑了别条航线，近岸浅水窗早已过去，此时硬闯只会刮穿船底。
<<else>>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper to "reef">><<set _npc.voyageLane to "reef">>
快艇熄了船头灯贴着近岸暗礁滑行，同日外海灰雾航道的平流窗口随之关闭。水下礁石离船底只有半尺，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把长竹篙塞给你：暗礁线避开了巡逻艇耳目，但撑船防触礁极耗腕力与胆识。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回调度 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "fog" or $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[用长篙抵开暗礁 (0:16)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpVesperReef>><<set $daily.mpVesperReef to 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mptideicon>><<link [[听暗流声替报水深 (0:14)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpVesperReef>><<set $daily.mpVesperReef to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Loop Fog [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "reef" or $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship">>
外海防波堤的铁链已经拉起，海关巡逻艇的探照灯在雾面来回扫视。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>按住舵柄说，因为今晚先跑了别条航线，外海深水道的免检潮窗已经合拢，今晚不能再出外海。
<<else>>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper to "fog">><<set _npc.voyageLane to "fog">>
座船驶入伸手不见五指的外海灰雾航道，同日近岸暗礁的浅水窗随之关闭。四周只有罗盘指针微弱的夜光，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>稳住主舵：灰雾线能多接一份大宗暗港舱单，但稍有偏航就会撞上海关暗哨。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回调度 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "reef" or $mpNpcLoopLock_vesper is "lightship">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[在底舱交接暗箱 (0:16)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpVesperFog>><<set $daily.mpVesperFog to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.manifests += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<mpalert 2>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[盯紧罗盘避开巡艇 (0:14)|MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpVesperFog>><<set $daily.mpVesperFog to 1>><<stress 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Loop Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
三号栈桥下的潮水正一寸寸漫回石阶，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>没有收摊，只把风灯挑亮，用粉笔在门柱上记下两道潮痕：一道是今夜走完的平流，一道是明晚重开的时辰。他说潮窗不等人，也不必等人，记准了总有一班船能出去。他把温着的搪瓷杯塞进你手里，自己蹲在栈桥边听水声，像在等一扇门重新打开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回夜航调度 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回契约深枢歇手 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Loop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
<<set _lane to (_npc.voyageLane is "reef" or _npc.voyageLane is "fog" ? _npc.voyageLane : "lightship")>>
快艇赶在天亮前滑回三号栈桥，本趟走的是<<if _lane is "reef">>近岸暗礁浅水道<<elseif _lane is "fog">>外海灰雾深航道<<else>>防波堤外灯船线<</if>>。当前契约刻度 <<print _npc.axis>>，暗港舱单 <<print _npc.manifests>> 份，旧航附页 <<print _npc.clausePages>> 页。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>摊开账册，看你要收拢舱单还是去船台改造座船。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[收拢暗港舱单 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpLoopSettleVesper>><<set $daily.mpLoopSettleVesper to 1>><<if (_npc.weekKey or -1) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.weekKey to _wk>><<set _npc.clausePages to Math.min(6, (_npc.clausePages or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 340 or _npc.axis gte 20>><<set _npc.manifests += ($mpWorldVesperEnding is "shadowfleet" ? 1 : 2)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _npc.manifests += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[拿舱单去改造座船 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Subsys]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Subsys [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
退潮后的船台隐在三号栈桥背面，座船被缆绳吊在半空：当前为<<if _npc.shipTier gte 3>>三阶破雾铜首，船头包覆锤打铜皮，浓雾急流皆可硬闯<<elseif _npc.shipTier gte 2>>二阶双层暗舱，底板下嵌有隔水密格<<elseif _npc.shipTier gte 1>>一阶静音木桨，桨架裹满吸音油麻布<<else>>零阶寻常旧木船，船肋还带着旧盐渍<</if>>。手头现有暗港舱单 <<print _npc.manifests>> 份，每投两份可升一阶。
栈桥下的暗流轻轻拍打着木桩，风灯在潮湿的舱板上映出一圈暖黄。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[投入舱单改船 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Subsys Upgrade]]>><<pass 15>><<if _npc.shipTier lt 3 and _npc.manifests gte 2>><<set _npc.manifests -= 2>><<set _npc.shipTier += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 5)>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去跑夜航攒新舱单 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Subsys Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
船台上的活计告一段落，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>抬手敲了敲新换的船肋，听那一声沉实的闷响。如今座船已升至<<if _npc.shipTier gte 3>>三阶破雾铜首<<elseif _npc.shipTier gte 2>>二阶双层暗舱<<elseif _npc.shipTier gte 1>>一阶静音木桨<<else>>初修船壳<</if>>，剩余暗港舱单 <<print _npc.manifests>> 份。底舱热茶已经温好，正好坐下歇息。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回船台页查看 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Subsys]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[靠在底舱卧铺休整 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if _npc.shipTier gte 1>><<stress -4>><<tiredness -2>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>

