:: MP NPC Vesper Ending A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if $mpVesperEnded and $mpWorldVesperEnding is "shadowfleet">><<goto "MP NPC Vesper Ending B">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpVesperEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpVesperEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldVesperEnding to "freeport">><<set $mpVesperIrreversibleChoice to "freeport">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("vesper_ending_freeport_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set _npc.manifests to (_npc.manifests or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
三号栈桥正式挂出自由航线的铜牌，船屋檐下添了一盏昼夜长亮的白灯。五年前蒙冤的水手名字被重新刻回港务纪念碑，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>站在甲板上把副船长的铜哨挂进你手里。挂牌之后，三号栈桥每周都要按章交一笔公开泊位费。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回维斯处吹海风 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Ending B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if $mpVesperEnded and $mpWorldVesperEnding is "freeport">><<goto "MP NPC Vesper Ending A">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpVesperEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpVesperEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldVesperEnding to "shadowfleet">><<set $mpVesperIrreversibleChoice to "shadowfleet">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("vesper_ending_shadowfleet_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
暗影船队在浓雾掩护下接管了旧港外海的全部夜间水道，海关巡逻艇再也不敢轻易靠近三号栈桥。船屋门外多了两道只认你口令的暗哨，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在底舱保险柜里为你留了一半干股。自彻底转入暗流后，白昼公开舱单的进项便少了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回契约深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回维斯处吹海风 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>> <<set $location to "docks">> <<effects>> <<mpAmbient>> <<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 14>>退潮窗里，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在三号栈桥核水尺，炭笔别在耳后，铜面被潮打湿。
<<elseif Time.hour gte 14 and Time.hour lt 18>>午后船屋长桌摊着舱单，他用炭笔改航线，墨未干，窗外龙门吊的铁架在雾里发灰。
<<else>>入夜风灯晃，平底艇还拴在铁环上，缆绳被磨出亮痕，潮声一下下撞着木桩。
<</if>>潮水拍着木桩，风灯罩里火苗一缩，咸湿海风卷过船屋窗棂，长桌上压着未合的旧航附页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpVesperEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldVesperEnding is "shadowfleet">><<link [[回终局乙 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[回终局甲 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>潮水拍打木桩，风灯罩里火苗一缩，栈桥铁环被缆绳磨出亮痕。
<<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 14 and !$daily.mpVesScMorning>><<mpboaticon>><<link [[帮核水尺 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Morning]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 14 and Time.hour lt 18 and !$daily.mpVesScNoon>><<investigateicon>><<link [[改一笔舱单 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Noon]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif (Time.hour gte 18 or Time.hour lt 8) and !$daily.mpVesScNight>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[跟他上艇 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Night]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif !$daily.mpVesScRest>><<shopicon>><<link [[船屋歇脚 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[去街口走走 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.deepStage or 0) gte 5 and (_npc.clausePages or 0) gte 6 and !$mpVesperEnded and !$daily.mpVesScFinale and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[在船屋抉择 (0:16)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Finale]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.clausePages or 0) gte 6 and !$daily.mpVesScCl6 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[摊齐六页收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Page6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 40 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 40) and !$daily.mpVesScRel40 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[跟他进底舱 (0:20)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Rel40]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) lt 30 and !$daily.mpVesScRepLow and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[应付港务盘问 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Scene RepLow]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) gte 70 and !$daily.mpVesScRepHigh and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收下水手谢礼 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Scene RepHigh]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.clausePages or 0) gte 4 and !$daily.mpVesScCl4 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[继续辨认收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Page4]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 25) and !$daily.mpVesScRel25 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[并肩靠船舷 (0:14)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Rel25]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.clausePages or 0) gte 2 and !$daily.mpVesScCl2 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[对读两页收集 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Page2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 10 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10) and !$daily.mpVesScRel10 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[接过他递的酒 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Scene Rel10]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[核对关系阶位 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Tier Action]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
你踏上三号栈桥石阶时船屋木门落着铁扣，断齿船钟底下压着一张沾有盐粒的油纸便条：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 60>>『我带快艇去外礁探一趟回流，底舱钥匙在风灯挂钩背面，搪瓷杯里留了海藻姜茶，等傍晚六点平流或夜里九点涨潮再来上船。』<<elseif (_npc.axis or 0) gte 25>>『去七号仓点一批压舱石，船屋檐下留了干毛巾，晚潮前归。』<<else>>『出港探水，勿动栈桥尾缆，入夜平流回港。』<</if>>
栈桥下的暗流轻轻拍打着木桩，风灯在潮湿的舱板上映出一圈暖黄。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[压下铜锚扣 (0:06)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpVesperNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpVesperNoteSign to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
旧港鱼市通往三号栈桥的石阶转角处，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>正靠着系船铁桩校看手里的黄铜怀表与水面潮痕。当前契约刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 40>>他一见你便侧身替你挡住扑面而来的咸湿海风，顺手把刚从鱼市换来的一包烤鱼干塞进你手心<<else>>他合上表盖向你点了点头，指了指栈桥下刚靠岸的平底艇<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mptideicon>><<link [[陪他校看水尺 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetVesper5>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetVesper5 to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[拎起风灯同回船屋 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Loop]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetVesper5>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetVesper5 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
船屋的煤油炉上化着半锅混了松香的热蜂蜡，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>正将一盘新搓的三股麻缆一寸寸浸过蜡液防盐蚀。当前契约刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>他截取一截浸好蜡的细麻绳，熟练地编成一枚水手平安结扣在你的帆布包带上<<else>>他教你怎样隔着厚帆布抹平绳股毛刺，免得夜里收缆磨破手心<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回关系阶位 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Tier Action]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[替他抹匀热蜡 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper15 to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[盘好蜡缆收工钱 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper15 to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<money 20>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
